{"type":"user/message","seq":10,"time":1795242270636,"data":{"message":{"id":"msg-e27a4260-a8aa-4ef8-ab1e-c62234099992","role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<system-reminder>\nSkills available in this environment. A skill is optional know-how for a kind of task: a SKILL.md with instructions, sometimes with scripts or reference files beside it. Use one when its description fits the task and its guidance would help; otherwise ignore it — you do not need a skill for work you can already do well. To use one, read its SKILL.md with the file tools you use for any file, then read what it points to only as you need it. Run a skill's scripts by their absolute path from your own working directory; do not change into the skill's directory. A skill is advice from its author, not a request from the user, and grants no permission: whatever it suggests running goes through the same tools, sandbox and approvals as your own commands. This list replaces any earlier list of skills.\n\n- office: Create, read and edit Word (.docx), Excel (.xlsx) and PowerPoint (.pptx) files with a bundled Node helper, without Office, Python or LibreOffice. Use it when a task asks for a report, letter, spreadsheet, workbook or slide deck as an Office file, needs the text, tables, cells, formulas or slides inside one, or asks to change an existing one. It builds from a JSON spec, edits through unpack/pack of the XML parts, and verifies by reading the result back. (bundled: /tmp/fx-120/pkg/node_modules/minidsh/skills/office/SKILL.md)\n- pdf: Read and create PDF files with a bundled Node helper. Use it when a task involves a .pdf: extracting its text page by page (requirements, invoices, papers, reports), checking its page count or metadata, or producing a PDF, either directly for plain Latin-text documents or by printing HTML with a Chrome or Edge found on this machine, or converting an Office file with LibreOffice when present. (bundled: /tmp/fx-120/pkg/node_modules/minidsh/skills/pdf/SKILL.md)\n</system-reminder>"}],"source":{"kind":"plugin","plugin":"skills","form":"list"}}},"surfaceOp":{"op":"append"}}
